flowchart TB
  SRC[Four original challenge files kept unchanged in approved VFL]
  SRC --> INV[Import receipt · table inventory · schema and unit check]
  INV --> QA[Field coverage · missingness · invalid-value diagnostics]

  subgraph A[Analytics Jobs · posting-like rows]
    A1[Normalize title and clean text in temporary WORK table]
    A2[Keep key_skills and job_description as separate fields]
    A3[Versioned phrase rules · one hit per skill per row]
    A4[Counts, eligible denominators, role/location/field summaries]
    A5[Exact-text duplicate sensitivity · no silent row deletion]
    A6[Human-labeled extraction audit · precision / recall / coverage]
    A7[Scenario sensitivity and reviewed aggregate finding]
    A1 --> A2 --> A3 --> A4 --> A5 --> A6 --> A7
  end

  subgraph D[DataScience Jobs · company/title-like records]
    D1[Verify title · reference_no · num_of_jobs meaning]
    D2[Retain records · profile repeated references]
    D3[Parse weights · flag missing, invalid, and negative values]
    D4[Record counts kept separate from supplied-weight sums]
    D5[Quantiles · title/company totals · cap and max-row sensitivity]
    D6[Reviewed interpretation · weight is not verified vacancy count]
    D1 --> D2 --> D3 --> D4 --> D5 --> D6
  end

  subgraph J[JDS Skill Traits · separate development research]
    J1[Verify label semantics · five trait fields · repeated-ID meaning]
    J2[Missingness · class prevalence · trait distributions]
    J3{Organizer approval and grouped-evaluation gates pass?}
    J4[Optional five-feature logistic experiment]
    J5[Grouped out-of-fold metrics vs prevalence baseline]
    J6[Exploratory within-JDS evidence only]
    J1 --> J2 --> J3
    J3 -->|Yes| J4 --> J5 --> J6
    J3 -->|No| J7[Model NOT RUN · keep descriptive results only]
  end

  subgraph S[SDS Personality Traits · isolated governance lane]
    S1[Verify variables, label, scale, and file-local IDs]
    S2[Missingness and aggregate descriptive summaries]
    S3[Disclosure review and separate evidence note]
    S4[No person-level model, ranking, or career action]
    S1 --> S2 --> S3 --> S4
  end

  QA --> A1
  QA --> D1
  QA --> J1
  QA --> S1
  A7 --> PASS[Evidence passport · source · unit · formula · denominator · run · limitations]
  D6 --> PASS
  J6 --> PASS
  J7 -. NOT RUN state .-> PASS
  S3 --> PASS
  PASS --> ACT{Permitted next step}
  ACT -->|Stable and reviewed| PILOT[Prioritize a reversible training pilot]
  ACT -->|Ambiguous mapping| REVIEW[Review the mapping or source definition]
  ACT -->|Insufficient or unstable evidence| COLLECT[Collect evidence or defer]
  S4 -. prohibited individual decision path .-> ACT
  EXT[External research and taxonomies] -. Methods/context only · no added rows or silent joins .-> PASS
  BOUNDARY[No row-level cross-file joins · no export from VFL without written approval]
  BOUNDARY -. governs .-> A1
  BOUNDARY -. governs .-> D1
  BOUNDARY -. governs .-> J1
  BOUNDARY -. governs .-> S1
